    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29685" root="عظم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَظِيمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A severe calamity</i> or <i>misfortune;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْظَمَةٌ</span></b> ; (S, K;) [and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْظَمٌ</span></b> , thus in a
verse cited in the S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ولب</span>:] pl. of the first
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَظَائِمُ</span>; and of the second ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَاظِمُ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[And <i>A great crime</i> or <i>the like;</i> a meaning well
known: so I have rendered it voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَّ</span>: in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طمر</span> in the O and TA, its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَظَائِمُ</span>, is rendered
by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذُنُوب</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطَمَّرٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِعْظَامَةٌ</span>.

